Operations' two extras aren't in this node. It is declared with only `Notifier<'digest'>`, and the target has no WASI adapter. There is no filesystem import for the log file and no `http-client` import for the metadata fetch. Adding either would mean widening the node's authority beyond its declared capabilities, so I left them out. They belong in a separate, explicitly granted node, or in host-side logging. The output is unaffected.

